<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT NORTHERN TERRITORY BY 48 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT NORTHERN TERRITORY BY 48 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>ALICE SPRINGS, Australia 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat</p>
<p>a Northern Territory Invitation XI by 48 runs in their limited</p>
<p>overs tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 218 for eight in 50 overs; Northern</p>
<p>Territory Invitation XI 170 all out in 42.5 overs.</p>
</text>
